reguntar quién atendió, el reclamo crece delante de los que esperan. ⚠️\n\nCon la venta a mano, se resuelve con el dato y no con la memoria de nadie. 💻🤖 ¿Cuántos reclamos así te llegan por mes? Mandáselo a quien está en el mostrador.\n\n#CasaDeRepuestos #Mostrador #Autopartes #Repuestos", "https://www.instagram.com/p/DeNmY4ejjfn/", "FEED_CAROUSEL_ALBUM", "7", "199", "1", "1", "526", "0"], ["20261006", "El pedido de siempre no siempre es el que hace falta. 👀 Lo que sale del mostrador cambia de un mes a otro, y tus ventas de las últimas semanas ya lo muestran. 💻 Pedile a Claude que las compare y te diga qué viene subiendo y qué se frenó antes de armar el pedido. 🤖🚀\n\nGuardalo 📌 y mandáselo al que hace las compras.\n\n#CasaDeRepuestos #IAaplicada #Repuestos #Stock", "https://www.instagram.com/p/DeKtCWqDVxK/", "FEED_CAROUSEL_ALBUM", "9", "150", "2", null, "383", "0"]]}, "ig_reels": {"fields": ["IGRE01", "IGRE03", "IGRE06", "IGRE09", "IGRE11", "IGRE12", "IGRE21", "IGRE23", "IGRE27", "IGRE28"], "rows": []}, "fb_evolucion": {"fields": ["FBEV17", "FBEV33", "FBEV34", "FBEV49", "FBEV21", "FBEV22", "_fecha"], "rows": [["976.0", null, null, "3075.0", null, null, "20261010"], ["976.0", null, "0.0", "4469.0", "0.0", "0.0", "20261011"], ["974.0", null, null, "5598.0", null, null, "20261005"], ["974.0", "1.0", null, "4228.0", null, null, "20261006"], ["974.0", "1.0", null, "3770.0", null, null, "20261007"], ["976.0", "1.0", null, "3919.0", null, null, "20261008"], ["976.0", null, null, "3612.0", null, null, "20261009"]]}, "li_evolucion": {"fields": ["LIEV01", "LIEV27", "LIEV22", "LIEV28", "LIEV21", "LIEV23", "LIEV20", "LIEV24", "_fecha"], "rows": [["105.0", null, "9.0", null, null, null, null, null, "20261010"], ["106.0", null, "9.0", null, null, "0.0", "0.0", null, "20261011"], ["105.0", null, "12.0", null, "1.0", null, null, null, "20261005"], ["105.0", null, "7.0", null, null, null, null, "1.0", "20261006"], ["105.0", null, "4.0", null, null, null, null, null, "20261007"], ["10